,"height":41},{"text":"자식","x":1603,"y":954,"width":59,"height":42},{"text":"스","x":1677,"y":966,"width":26,"height":32}]},{"text":"레드를 생성한 후 부모는 자신의 실행을 재개하여 부모와 자식 스레드가 서로 독립적으","words":[{"text":"레드를","x":325,"y":1024,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"생성한","x":445,"y":1025,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"후","x":563,"y":1026,"width":35,"height":39},{"text":"부모는","x":611,"y":1026,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"자신의","x":730,"y":1024,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"실행을","x":850,"y":1024,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"재개하여","x":969,"y":1024,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"부모와","x":1121,"y":1024,"width":109,"height":40},{"text":"자식","x":1243,"y":1024,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"스레드가","x":1331,"y":1024,"width":149,"height":40},{"text":"서로","x":1495,"y":1024,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"독립적으","x":1581,"y":1022,"width":122,"height":42}]},{"text":"로 병행하게 실행된다. 스레드가 독립적이기 때문에 스레드 사이의 데이터 공유는 거의","words":[{"text":"로","x":323,"y":1096,"width":36,"height":29},{"text":"병행하게","x":376,"y":1092,"width":135,"height":41},{"text":"실행된다.","x":529,"y":1092,"width":145,"height":41},{"text":"스레드가","x":691,"y":1092,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"독립적이기","x":844,"y":1091,"width":171,"height":41},{"text":"때문에","x":1036,"y":1091,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"스레드","x":1155,"y":1092,"width":107,"height":41},{"text":"사이의","x":1278,"y":1092,"width":105,"height":41},{"text":"데이터","x":1405,"y":1091,"width":104,"height":41},{"text":"공유는","x":1529,"y":1090,"width":106,"height":40},{"text":"거의","x":1649,"y":1092,"width":51,"height":46}]},{"text":"없다. 비동기 스레딩은 그림 4.2에서 묘사된 다중 스레드 서버에서 시용되는 전략이고","words":[{"text":"없다.","x":326,"y":1159,"width":75,"height":40},{"text":"비동기","x":422,"y":1160,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"스레딩은","x":540,"y":1160,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"그림","x":695,"y":1159,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"4.2에서","x":780,"y":1159,"width":117,"height":41},{"text":"묘사된","x":918,"y":1160,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"다중","x":1041,"y":1159,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"스레드","x":1128,"y":1160,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"서버에서","x":1253,"y":1160,"width":140,"height":41},{"text":"시용되는","x":1416,"y":1159,"width":148,"height":41},{"text":"전략이고","x":1582,"y":1157,"width":121,"height":43}]},{"text":"반응형 사용자 인터페이스를 설계하는 데에도 흔히 사우된다.","words":[{"text":"반응형","x":324,"y":1226,"width":100,"height":41},{"text":"사용자","x":440,"y":1227,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"인터페이스를","x":559,"y":1227,"width":205,"height":40},{"text":"설계하는","x":777,"y":1226,"width":140,"height":41},{"text":"데에도","x":931,"y":1227,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"흔히","x":1046,"y":1226,"width":66,"height":41},{"text":"사우된다.","x":1129,"y":1227,"width":151,"height":41}]},{"text":"동기 스레딩은 부모 스레드가 하나 이상의 자식 스레드를 생성하고 자식 스레드 모","words":[{"text":"동기","x":387,"y":1294,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"스레딩은","x":472,"y":1295,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"부모","x":624,"y":1295,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"스레드가","x":708,"y":1294,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"하나","x":862,"y":1294,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"이상의","x":949,"y":1294,"width":100,"height":41},{"text":"자식","x":1067,"y":1294,"width":67,"height":41},{"text":"스레드를","x":1153,"y":1296,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"생성하고","x":1312,"y":1296,"width":149,"height":40},{"text":"자식","x":1477,"y":1295,"width":69,"height":41},{"text":"스레드","x":1565,"y":1293,"width":100,"height":41},{"text":"모","x":1676,"y":1302,"width":27,"height":31}]},{"text":"두가 종료할 때까지 기다렸다가 자신의 실행을 재개하는 방식을 말한다 여기서 부모가","words":[{"text":"두가","x":322,"y":1361,"width":72,"height":39},{"text":"종료할","x":406,"y":1361,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"때까지","x":525,"y":1361,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"기다렸다가","x":644,"y":1361,"width":174,"height":41},{"text":"자신의","x":830,"y":1361,"width":102,"height":41},{"text":"실행을","x":952,"y":1361,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"재개하는","x":1072,"y":1361,"width":142,"height":41},{"text":"방식을","x":1229,"y":1363,"width":110,"height":39},{"text":"말한다","x":1354,"y":1363,"width":119,"height":